atory drugs) are recommended.", "runs": [{"text": "Habit Adjustments:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Smoking"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cessation"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "avoidance"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "NSAIDs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(nonsteroidal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "anti-inflammatory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "drugs)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are "}, {"text": "recommended."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1506"}}, {"id": "body-09105", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Other Therapies:", "runs": [{"text": "Other"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Therapies:"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1506"}}, {"id": "body-09106", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Herbal Remedies: Some herbal teas (ginger, chamomile, peppermint) or preparations like STW-5 (Iberis amara) may provide relief,", "runs": [{"text": "Herbal Remedies:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Some herbal teas (ginger, chamomile, peppermint) or preparations like STW-5 (Iberis amara) may provide relief,"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1506"}}, {"id": "body-09107", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Acupuncture/Electrical Stimulation: These may be used for symptom management,", "runs": [{"text": "Acupuncture/Electrical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Stimulation:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "These"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "used"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "symptom"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "management,"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1506"}}, {"id": "body-09109", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Psychotherapy:", "runs": [{"text": "Psychotherapy:"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1506"}}, {"id": "body-09110", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Psychological therapies, particularly CBT, are considered effec